      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.39 (down from ₹0.65 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.90b (up 17% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹17.9m (down 41% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 0.9% (down from 1.9% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 42% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 16% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
