      "date": "2026-01-08T11:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "Incredible Industries Limited Appoints Raj Prakash Verma as Non-Executive (Non-Independent) Director, Effective November 14, 2025",
      "body": "Incredible Industries Limited has approved a notice of Postal Ballot for appointment of Mr. Raj Prakash Verma (DIN: 09305391) as a Non-Executive (Non-Independent) Director of the Company who was appointed as an Additional Director of the Company at the board meeting held on November 14, 2025. The Board of Directors had appointed Central Depository Services (India) Limited to provide e-voting facilities for the Postal Ballot. It was decided to take the cut-off date for notice of Postal Ballot as January 2, 2026. The meeting of Board of Directors of the Company was held on January 8, 2026.",
